    "displayName": "Find Lost Supply Ship",
    "titleSource": "localized_clean",
    "titleConfidence": "high",
    "briefing": "Hey,\n\nI’m concerned a [Ship] moving medical supplies for us might’ve come under attack. The signal was lost around [Location], which has seen a spike in outlaw activity recently. Losing that ship alone would be bad enough, but it’ll be even worse if those supplies don’t make it to [Destination]. \n\nWe would need you to search for the ship at its last known position, recover the supplies, and then take them to [Destination]. Your help would make a bad situation better. \n\nAlso, to make your life easier, I'd make sure you have a handheld tractor beam with you. \n\nThanks,\n\nLima Endicott\nLead Dispatcher\nCitizens for Prosperity",
